1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,300
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) They play hide-and-seek at school.

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,000
Kyle is the seeker.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:10,540
He closes his eyes and counts to ten.

4
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,260
The other people hide.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,900
Some people hide behind trees.

6
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,940
Some people hide behind the slide.

7
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:25,620
Some people go inside classrooms.

8
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:30,920
The seeker tries to find all his friends.

9
00:00:31,479 --> 00:00:35,220
He needs to find all eight of his

10
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,880
friends to win.
